1</issue>):<fpage>51</fpage><lpage>54</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mehdi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Closset</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gay</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic treatment of a sigmoid perforation after colonoscopy</article-title>. <source>Surg Endsoc</source>. <year>1996</year>;<volume>10</volume>:<fpage>352</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>353</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hayashi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Urata</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Munakata</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic closure for perforation of the sigmoid colon by endoscopic linear stapler</article-title>. <source>Surg Laparosc Endosc</source>. <year>1996</year>;<volume>6</volume>(<issue>5</issue>):<fpage>411</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>413</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8890432</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goh</surname><given-names>PMY</given-names></name><name><surname>Kum</surname><given-names>C-K</given-names></name><name><surname>Chia</surname><given-names>Y-W</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic repair of perforation of the colon during colonoscopy</article-title>. <source>Gastrointest Endsoc</source>. <year>1994</year>;<volume>40</volume>(<issue>4</issue>):<fpage>496</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>497</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="